ke care  of pets left alone when their owners are  in hospital or are put into isolation  we are just a forms of assistance  according to the needs of the pet owners  either to evacuate and take care of it  completely or we take care of it  temporarily like lettuce we help to feed  the animals clean the cage or bathe the  dogs  he says the biggest challenge of the  work is when they get notified that a  pet's owner has died scott heidler al  jazeera bangkok
 

